================================================================================

The eight JSON assets under app/src/main/assets/ (centres.json, job_roles.json,
districts.json, district_economy.json, gia_funding_rules.json, lexicon.json,
i18n.json, config.json) are DATA, not software, and are released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You may copy, redistribute and build upon this data, including commercially,
provided you credit "JanDwar data pack, Team Nymeriaa (2026)" and link back to
this repository.

The underlying facts were compiled from 190 public Government of India and
public-sector sources, each recorded per record in the `source` field with a
`retrieved` date and a `confidence` grade. The compilation, normalisation,
confidence grading and schema are the contribution licensed here; the
underlying public records remain the property of their originating bodies.

Record counts as published:
  - 660 training-centre records  (294 CONFIRMED, 350 LIKELY, 16 UNVERIFIED;
    392 carry a published phone number, 268 do not)
  - 476 usable NSQF job roles    (386 carry an NSQF level, 380 carry notional
    hours; missing values render as an em dash and are never inferred)
  - 187 districts across 5 states, 190 logged sources

